{"displayStem":"뇌종괴 환자의 동맥압과 ICP를 같은 기준 높이에서 동시에 기록한 교육 모형이다. CPP≈MAP−ICP로 단순화한다.10분 이후에는 ICP를 낮추는 처치와 동시에 MAP도 떨어졌다. 특정 환자의 치료 목표 CPP는 제시하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>동시에 기록한 압력</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"동시에 기록한 압력。시간 (min)、압력 (mmHg)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">압력 (mmHg)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">22.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">27.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">55</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">82.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">110</text><polyline points=\"76,86.63636363636363 222.66666666666666,86.63636363636363 369.3333333333333,118.27272727272728 516,118.27272727272728\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"86.63636363636363\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"222.66666666666666\" cy=\"86.63636363636363\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"369.3333333333333\" cy=\"118.27272727272728\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"118.27272727272728\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">MAP</text><polyline points=\"76,197.36363636363637 222.66666666666666,181.54545454545456 369.3333333333333,189.45454545454544 516,189.45454545454544\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></polyline><rect x=\"73.9\" y=\"195.26363636363638\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"220.56666666666666\" y=\"179.44545454545457\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"367.2333333333333\" y=\"187.35454545454544\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"513.9\" y=\"187.35454545454544\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"342\" y=\"306\">ICP</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">시간 (min)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>"]}